{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1110825001:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様！こんなに早く解放されるなんて……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，没想到我们能这么快重获自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA108539396C12E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110825002:1":{"text":"ババリアの姿がない……","source_cn":"……这里没有蛮血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13FE570712DDDF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110825003:1":{"text":"あいつらはどこだ？","source_cn":"他们人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093F96E09ECD562B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110825004:1":{"text":"ババリア……俺たちと一緒に捕まった子たちなら、別の場所に連れて行かれたよ。","source_cn":"蛮血……和我们一起被抓来的蛮血，都被提前转运走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3952F15A2EB16B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110825005:1":{"text":"ババリアは反抗的だが、人間よりも体力と力があるから、さっさと「あそこ」へ連れて行こうってサンドクローの奴らが言ってたな……","source_cn":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0DC2180EB4C63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1110825005":{"text":"ババリアは反抗的だが、人間よりも体力と力があるから、さっさと「あそこ」へ連れて行こうってサンドクローの奴らが言ってたな……","source_cn":"流沙之爪说，蛮血反抗心强，体力和力量都比我们好，应该尽早送去“该去的地方”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0DC2180EB4C63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110825006:1":{"text":"そこまでは……あんたらが来なかったら、俺たちも連れて行かれたかもしれないけど。","source_cn":"不知道……你们要是再迟来几小时，我们也会被带走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA14CF9930A215F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110825007:1":{"text":"サンドクローの話を聞くに、奴らは俺たちやババリアに力仕事をさせたいようだ。","source_cn":"我听刚才那些流沙之爪的意思，是要强迫蛮血和我们干力气活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA48A98F1397D337C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110825008:1":{"text":"労働させるのが目的なら、ひとまず命の危険はないはずだ……奴らに刃向かわなければ痛い目に遭うこともないだろう。","source_cn":"只是干苦力的话，应该暂时不会有危险……只要不忤逆流沙之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0EA9B7B8116696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110825009:1":{"text":"あいつらはウール族だ、きっと最後まで抵抗する。","source_cn":"他们是乌尔氏族的人，会抗争到底。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37685675F41081F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110825010:1":{"text":"急がないと……","source_cn":"我们得尽快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x092C878B78AB9859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110825011:1":{"text":"いったん彼らを商隊に送り届けましょう。皆さんかなり弱っているようです。","source_cn":"先把这些人送回商队吧，他们看起来状态不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A49CDDC703DED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110825012:1":{"text":"分かった。","source_cn":"好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2839CC05014FE4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"どこに連れて行かれたんだ？","source_cn":"他们被送去哪里了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x86AE2B0A58BDBE52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どこに連れて行かれたんだ？","female":"どこに連れて行かれたの？","variant_male_record_index":"64132","variant_female_record_index":"64133","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"危険な場所なのか？","source_cn":"不会有生命危险吧？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F202B0514DDF6CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"危険な場所なのか？","female":"危険な場所なの？","variant_male_record_index":"64134","variant_female_record_index":"64135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:劳工安德斯":{"text":"労働者アンドス","source":"劳工安德